<translate>
==== HitAngleMod ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
A parameter that affects the attack sector (how many targets will be captured in one hit). The default value is zero. The smaller, the larger the range.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
HitAngleMod = -30,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

